  "css": "/* Latest posts cannot leave out the post being read, so it asks for four and\n   this post's own card is hidden (or, when it is not among them, the fourth). */\n[data-bz-node=\"related-posts\"] .bz-card[href$=\"/lift-axle-troubleshooting-for-trailer-owners\"] { display: none; }\n[data-bz-node=\"related-posts\"] .bz-grid:not(:has(.bz-card[href$=\"/lift-axle-troubleshooting-for-trailer-owners\"])) > .bz-card:nth-child(n+4) { display: none; }\n\n/* The hero photograph is framed a little high, as the design frames it. */\n[data-bz-section=\"post-hero\"] [data-bz-node=\"ph-photo\"] img { object-position: center 35%; }\n"
